pcss 
-> style a web page
-> Cascading Style Sheets
->control the layout of multiple web page at once
->External style Sheets stored in css files

types of css
->inline-useing style attribute inside html elements
->intetnal-using <style> element in <head>
->External-using link

inline css
for one element
<p style=:color: red; font-size: 42px;">hello world</p>

internal css
for one web-page
<head>
    <style>
        .greeting {
            color: #0284c7;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-family: "Poppins', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
<head/>

External css
for many web-pages
.card-text {
    color: #16a34a;
    font-size: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #161341;
}